      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think a better idea is to grab the avatar id to save from constantly grabbing the api and when they change their avatar like the old pedistals use to work. It shouldnt be hard to bring back in a different way, but it would be best to get the id from your friend though.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
